sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant F as Frontend
    participant I as IPFS
    participant W as Wallet
    participant S as Smart Contract
    participant B as Blockchain

    Note over C,B: Job Creation Flow

    C->>F: Open Create Job Form
    F->>C: Display Form
    C->>F: Fill Form Details
    F->>F: Validate Inputs

    F->>I: Upload Job Metadata
    I-->>F: Return CID

    F->>W: Request Transaction
    W->>C: Confirm + ETH Amount
    C->>W: Approve Transaction

    W->>S: CreateJob(CID) + ETH
    S->>S: Validate msg.value > 0
    S->>S: Generate jobID
    S->>S: Create Job Struct
    S->>S: Lock Escrow Funds

    S->>B: Store Job State
    S->>B: Emit JobCreated Event

    B-->>F: Transaction Confirmed
    F->>C: Show Success Message
    F->>F: Update Job Listings
